<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:42,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh oh!</font>

32
00:01:43,660 --> 00:01:44,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pakkun?</font>

33
00:01:45,250 --> 00:01:46,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan?</font>

34
00:01:51,750 --> 00:01:54,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you stop
all of a sudden?!</font>

35
00:01:55,050 --> 00:01:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The scents of Sasuke and the other two...
are quickly moving away!</font>

36
00:02:00,550 --> 00:02:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It smells like Sasuke is
chasing those two people...</font>

37
00:02:05,220 --> 00:02:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— Sasuke-kun is?</font>

38
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:09,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no other signs
of movement.</font>

39
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:11,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

40
00:02:11,650 --> 00:02:15,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's not just stand around.
Let's go after Sasuke right away!</font>

41
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... what?</font>

42
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The people who are left are going
to fight each other.</font>

43
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll end up taking a little longer way...</font>

44
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but all there is for us to do
is to avoid it.</font>

45
00:02:27,250 --> 00:02:31,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?! If we do that, it'll only delay our
catching up to Sasuke.</font>

46
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's just speed on through!</font>

47
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying, Naruto?!</font>

48
00:02:35,130 --> 00:02:37,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't know what'll happen
in the battle zone!</font>

49
00:02:38,470 --> 00:02:39,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if we don't desire it,</font>

50
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:43,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's a possibility that
we'll be irrepressibly caught up in a battle.</font>

51
00:02:43,810 --> 00:02:45,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That doesn't have anything
to do with it!</font>

52
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:49,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kid! Our mission is to bring
Sasuke back.</font>

53
00:02:50,190 --> 00:02:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the cardinal rule is to avoid battle
as much as possible until then!</font>

54
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:55,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Let's go!
— Got it!</font>

55
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine!</font>

56
00:03:14,290 --> 00:03:15,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Puppet Master Jutsu!</font>

57
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm from the Aburame Clan
of the Leaf Village...</font>

58
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we fight,
we never underestimate our opponent,</font>

59
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter what puny insects
they may be.</font>

60
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:11,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll advance with full force!</font>

61
00:04:12,770 --> 00:04:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring it!</font>

62
00:04:36,170 --> 00:04:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Put me down, Temari.</font>

63
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you move, Gaara?</font>

64
00:04:45,260 --> 00:04:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara!</font>

65
00:04:51,770 --> 00:04:54,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kankuro is delaying Uchiha now.</font>

66
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:56,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must use this opening...</font>

67
00:04:59,610 --> 00:05:01,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we don't get a move on,
the operation will...</font>

68
00:05:02,990 --> 00:05:03,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

69
00:05:04,450 --> 00:05:06,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari, go over there.</font>

70
00:05:06,950 --> 00:05:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

71
00:05:07,820 --> 00:05:12,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just beat it! You're in the way!</font>

72
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:41,190
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Astonishment!</font>

73
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:41,190
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Gaara's True Identity</font>

74
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:11,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Poison on the blade!</font>

75
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:26,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away!</font>

76
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:46,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... Uchiha Sasuke!
Did he get past Kankuro?!</font>

77
00:06:47,470 --> 00:06:49,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... No matter how you look at it,
it's too soon.</font>

78
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did another assailant come?</font>

79
00:06:53,470 --> 00:06:56,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what you Sand Ninja
are scheming...</font>

80
00:06:56,970 --> 00:06:59,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'll stop you!</font>

81
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

82
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:11,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll ascertain your true identity!</font>

83
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:16,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara!</font>

84
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me...!</font>

85
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he going to rouse that thing
in a place like this?!</font>

86
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no joke...
It's out of my hands.</font>

87
00:07:29,970 --> 00:07:32,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, Gaara!
Have you forgotten the operation?!</font>

88
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:36,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You who are strong...
You who are called Uchiha...</font>

89
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:38,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You who have friends...</font>

90
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You who have a purpose...</font>

91
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:45,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You who are like... me!</font>

92
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:49,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By killing you...</font>

93
00:07:50,110 --> 00:07:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will exist in this world as
the one who destroyed all of that...</font>

94
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:59,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can truly experience "life."</font>

95
00:08:02,330 --> 00:08:03,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

96
00:08:04,130 --> 00:08:07,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's so obvious if you release
such a blood-thirsty aura...</font>

97
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on out.</font>

98
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's you, eh...</font>

99
00:08:17,850 --> 00:08:22,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your purpose?
Why do you seek power?</font>

100
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:31,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's none of your business.</font>

101
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Beat it!
You're a hindrance to my training.</font>

102
00:08:47,590 --> 00:08:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

103
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have the same eyes as I do.</font>

104
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:58,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eyes that seek power,
brimming with hate and murderous intent.</font>

105
00:08:58,850 --> 00:09:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're like me.</font>

106
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't forget... You're my...</font>

107
00:09:06,690 --> 00:09:07,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're...</font>

108
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my...</font>

109
00:09:24,290 --> 00:09:28,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... my...</font>

110
00:09:31,300 --> 00:09:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my prey!</font>

111
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's started...!</font>

112
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:54,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Substitution?!</font>

113
00:09:57,780 --> 00:09:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're naive.</font>

114
00:10:09,210 --> 00:10:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

115
00:10:21,180 --> 00:10:21,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Insects?!</font>

116
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:28,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you'd make
a clone out of insects and</font>

117
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:30,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">wrap around behind me...</font>

118
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not bad!</font>

119
00:10:32,150 --> 00:10:35,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your reach encompasses from medium
to long distance and you use a puppet.</font>

120
00:10:36,070 --> 00:10:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think you would
do well in close combat.</font>

121
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:41,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that Puppet Master Jutsu
where you have to concentrate</font>

122
00:10:42,030 --> 00:10:43,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on the control of the puppet...</font>

123
00:10:44,830 --> 00:10:47,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the one casting the Jutsu is
prone to openings in defense.</font>

124
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're very aware of the weakness
of a puppet master!</font>

125
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:55,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, from here on,</font>

126
00:10:55,170 --> 00:10:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll show you the essence of
this Ninjutsu fighting style!</font>

127
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:03,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real terror of Crow...
my puppet of warfare!</font>

128
00:11:13,770 --> 00:11:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Poison Smoke Bomb!</font>

129
00:11:26,410 --> 00:11:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I inhale... a little bit?</font>

130
00:11:29,290 --> 00:11:33,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it...
And the caster of the Jutsu hides, eh?</font>

131
00:11:56,230 --> 00:11:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, everyone...</font>

132
00:11:57,940 --> 00:12:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if enemy Shinobi appear,
don't panic.</font>

133
00:12:01,610 --> 00:12:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go into the hidden room quickly.</font>

134
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:11,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your Jonin and Chunin Senseis
will protect you all with their lives!</font>

135
00:12:28,350 --> 00:12:29,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

136
00:12:29,890 --> 00:12:31,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-chan...</font>

137
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:33,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be okay!</font>

138
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:35,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's doing their best.</font>

139
00:12:36,270 --> 00:12:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They can drive away
the enemies right away.</font>

140
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cracks in the face rock
of the Hokage...</font>

141
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How ominous...</font>

142
00:12:56,170 --> 00:12:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandpa...</font>

143
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:18,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To have come this far...
To have come this far...!</font>

144
00:13:20,110 --> 00:13:27,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do I already lack the power
to drag out his soul?</font>

145
00:13:28,450 --> 00:13:30,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this feeble body...</font>

146
00:13:30,580 --> 00:13:33,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though I'm prepared to die,
is it not enough...?!</font>

147
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You probably could've killed me
if you'd been ten years younger.</font>

148
00:13:52,850 --> 00:13:57,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sarutobi! If you don't kill him now,
the village is doomed!</font>

149
00:13:58,150 --> 00:13:59,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you understand?!</font>

150
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... understand!</font>

151
00:14:13,290 --> 00:14:16,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Useless... old man...</font>

152
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:42,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... Let me feel it!</font>

153
00:14:44,230 --> 00:14:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That eye!</font>

154
00:14:48,070 --> 00:14:50,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That eye... from before!</font>

155
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:36,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This doesn't look like it'll end
by the time you come for back-up...</font>

156
00:15:37,410 --> 00:15:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino...</font>

157
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like the poison has
slowly started to circulate.</font>

158
00:15:48,340 --> 00:15:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll finish this!</font>

159
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:04,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Insects, again?!</font>

160
00:16:05,650 --> 00:16:08,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he shouldn't be able to
move so much in that state...</font>

161
00:16:16,910 --> 00:16:18,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make things easier for you...</font>

162
00:16:21,790 --> 00:16:22,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What's wrong?!</font>

163
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:28,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's happening...?</font>

164
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:32,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me...!</font>

165
00:16:33,630 --> 00:16:36,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's futile...
He can't move anymore...</font>

166
00:16:37,930 --> 00:16:41,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had the beetles burrow
into every joint...</font>

167
00:16:43,690 --> 00:16:46,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He stuffed beetles into its joints
so that the puppet can't move?</font>

168
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was his aim from the beginning!</font>

169
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:53,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The beetles are passing through
the threads of my Chakra...</font>

170
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

171
00:16:56,410 --> 00:16:59,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!
As I recall, their food is Chakra.</font>

172
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:07,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate,
my location will be found out!</font>

173
00:17:11,340 --> 00:17:14,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He cut the Chakra threads himself...?</font>

174
00:17:27,650 --> 00:17:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You got careless!</font>

175
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:33,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instantly reattaching the Chakra threads
that have once been cut</font>

176
00:17:33,150 --> 00:17:36,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is simple for a first-rate puppet master.</font>

177
00:17:36,950 --> 00:17:37,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

178
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crow is a puppet...</font>

179
00:17:41,450 --> 00:17:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that has a weapon in each
and every component of the body!</font>

180
00:17:47,370 --> 00:17:50,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a big mistake if you think
this has ended...</font>

181
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by your stopping my movements!</font>

182
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:55,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's lots of poison
on the tip of the needle...</font>

183
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:57,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

184
00:18:07,850 --> 00:18:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

185
00:18:19,030 --> 00:18:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like that, the insects...!</font>

186
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:23,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chakra threads have been
bitten through!</font>

187
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:39,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Why...?!</font>

188
00:18:39,340 --> 00:18:42,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did these insects
spring out from?!</font>

189
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:46,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By beating away the bait insects
along the Chakra threads,</font>

190
00:18:47,060 --> 00:18:48,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you dropped your guard.</font>

191
00:18:48,600 --> 00:18:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You didn't notice...
the wriggling insects behind you.</font>

192
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:58,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The insects were moving
the whole time...</font>

193
00:18:59,530 --> 00:19:02,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">heading for your headband.</font>

194
00:19:02,740 --> 00:19:04,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What did you say?!</font>

195
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one blow earlier...</font>

196
00:19:06,750 --> 00:19:11,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I pretended to miss and
stuck one of those beetles on you.</font>

197
00:19:17,090 --> 00:19:20,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But how did you know where I was
with one such beetle...?</font>

198
00:19:21,970 --> 00:19:25,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... hate explaining the same thing twice.</font>

199
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:33,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino?
Why are you here?!</font>

200
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I put a female beetle on you
before you left the arena!</font>

201
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The females have almost no smell...</font>

202
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only a male can sniff out
the subtle smell of the female.</font>

203
00:19:51,790 --> 00:19:53,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, this one beetle on my forehead...</font>

204
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right... It's a female.</font>

205
00:20:07,140 --> 00:20:10,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The poison has circulated
through my whole body, huh...</font>

206
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:14,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like I won't be able
to go to back you up...</font>

207
00:20:14,940 --> 00:20:18,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Uchiha Sasuke.</font>

208
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he a... monster?</font>

209
00:20:33,540 --> 00:20:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you scared of me, Uchiha Sasuke?!</font>

210
00:20:42,550 --> 00:20:44,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of my existence?!</font>

211
00:20:46,890 --> 00:20:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come out...
Uchiha Sasuke!</font>

212
00:20:53,140 --> 00:20:55,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... my...</font>

213
00:20:56,270 --> 00:21:00,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">prey!</font>

214
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

215
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

216
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

217
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

218
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

219
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

220
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

221
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

222
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

223
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

224
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

225
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

226
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

227
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

228
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

229
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

230
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

231
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

232
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

233
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

234
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

235
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

236
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:50,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What a speed and strength!</font>

237
00:22:51,430 --> 00:22:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If I didn't use my Sharingan
to foresee his movement,</font>

238
00:22:53,600 --> 00:22:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I would have been in pieces!</font>

239
00:22:56,100 --> 00:22:58,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But a merely defensive battle
will do no good.</font>

240
00:22:58,770 --> 00:22:59,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What do I do?</font>

241
00:22:59,980 --> 00:23:03,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">How should I stop him?
Do I need to use that...?</font>

242
00:23:04,570 --> 00:23:06,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But Chidori may not...</font>

243
00:23:08,150 --> 00:23:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Exceeding the Limit... Sasuke's Decision!!"</font>

